.jpeg","position_uncertainty_m":50,"geometry_basis":"Separate neighboring storefronts. Placement south of 2930 follows the earlier user identification; the StoryMap pin is about 48 m north. Exact address remains unresolved. 1985 MAPABA meeting is evidence of Golden Dragon as a venue, not proof that the 1976 building or address remained unchanged. No opening/closing or demolition year inferred.","exteriorPhases":[{"from":1976,"through":1976,"text":"Separate neighboring storefronts. Placement south of 2930 follows the earlier user identification; the StoryMap pin is about 48 m north. Exact address remains unresolved. 1985 MAPABA meeting is evidence of Golden Dragon as a venue, not proof that the 1976 building or address remained unchanged. No opening/closing or demolition year inferred.","text_zh":"两间相邻店面。2930 南侧的候选位置沿用此前用户识别；StoryMap 标点在北约 48 米。确切门牌尚未解决。"}]}},"newBuildings":[{"id":"r67-gold-dollar","polygon":[[-83.05972684457586,42.34355650811388],[-83.05963161707851,42.343393634716],[-83.05980414444595,42.34333812180671],[-83.05984351347448,42.34340545815085],[-83.0599371590387,42.34337532576284],[-83.05992711549598,42.343358147439986],[-83.06016454842221,42.34328174822155],[-83.0602304512255,42.343394465070006]],"holes":[],"height":4.8,"height_basis":"One-storey 2016 photo reference; parapet and depths proportional, not surveyed.","source_year":2024,"source_url":"https://www.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=c9bd1139cb15497084c328315a2c0c84","sourceIds":["R67_GOLD_HISTORY","R36_MODEL_GOLD_DOLLAR","SEMCOG_2024"],"geometry_basis":"SEMCOG building-footprint inventory; shape from dated aerial mapping. Original survey registration uncertainty retained.","district":"new","survey_id":"merchant-reference","name":"Gold Dollar building","inventory":{"from":1930,"through":2024,"built":1930,"demolished":2019,"demolition_raw":1565308800000,"stories":1,"source":"SANBORN","building_id":8135160,"map_overlaps":["new-1950-49","new-1897-78037-56","new-map-43","new-1950-50","new-1897-78037